{"product":{"id":9985700725024,"title":"Terreno T70 Coarse Loose Gravel Endurance","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe Terreno T70 Coarse Loose Gravel Endurance tire brings World Championship - winning mountain bike technology to your gravel rig. With a T-score of 70, the Terreno T70 is designed for riders who thrive on rugged gravel routes, where loose surfaces and unpredictable conditions are the norm.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdapted from the proven Mezcal XC tread design, the T70 delivers XC race-level speed and grip, and is now optimized for coarse, loose gravel. Built from the Endurance Formulation powered by Graphene, the T70 tread offers weather-resistant dependability, all-condition performance, and the long-lasting resilience needed for epic gravel outings. A fast-rolling center tread ensures momentum on straights, while aggressive shoulder knobs and full-depth tread siping bring control and confidence in corners, offering exceptional traction when terrain gets technical. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt on Vittoria’s Endurance Casing, the T70 offers high adaptability and toughness for long-distance adventures. Reinforced nylon sidewall protection and an anti-puncture belt provide the durability and stability needed to handle rough terrain and sharp impacts.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"Gravel Tire","created_at":"2025-06-26T02:30:40-05:00","handle":"terreno-t70-gravel-endurance","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:23-05:00","published_at":"2025-07-10T07:00:06-05:00","template_suffix":"terreno-t50","published_scope":"global","tags":"Discounted products, EP70, Gravel, Gravel Endurance, IPP40, Sitewide, Tires","variants":[{"id":50350106738976,"product_id":9985700725024,"title":"700x37c \/ Black","price":"81.99","sku":"11A00802","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"700x37c","option2":"Black","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-06-26T02:30:40-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-1